<section class="auth-card" aria-labelledby="forgot-heading">
  <h1 id="forgot-heading">Forgot password</h1>
  <p class="page-intro">There is no self-service password reset on this installation: password resets are issued by an administrator.</p>
  <p>Ask an administrator to reset the password for your account. They will set a new password for you, and you can sign in with it right away.</p>
  <p class="auth-links">
    <a class="button" href="{{login_url}}">Back to sign in</a>
    <a class="button button-secondary" href="{{register_url}}">Create an account</a>
  </p>
</section>
